            <h2>Helping Students Succeed Worldwide 🌍</h2>
            <p>
                Thousands of students use AIStudyAssistant to boost productivity and master their subjects faster.
            </p>

            <div class="stats">
                <div class="stat">
                    <h3>5,000+</h3>
                    <span>Students Helped</span>
                </div>
                <div class="stat">
                    <h3>20,000+</h3>
                    <span>PDFs Summarized</span>
                </div>
                <div class="stat">
                    <h3>50,000+</h3>
                    <span>AI Questions Answered</span>
                </div>
            </div>
